        "snippet": "Key Cost Factors in Utah"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Tear-off and Layers: Removing multiple existing shingle layers (common in older Utah homes) adds labor and disposal fees."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Snow Underlayment & Ice/Water Shield: Utah's heavy winter snow loads require specialized ice-and-water protection and proper eave detailing, which can add to the baseline price."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Pitch and Complexity: Steep roofs, multiple dormers, or hard-to-access layouts increase labor costs."
          },
